tures.","j":30,"h":60,"s":98,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"98:8","t":"Their reward with their Lord will be gardens of perpetual residence beneath which rivers flow, wherein they will abide forever, Allāh being pleased with them and they with Him. That is for whoever has feared his Lord.","j":30,"h":60,"s":98,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"99:1","t":"When the earth is shaken with its [final] earthquake","j":30,"h":60,"s":99,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"99:2","t":"And the earth discharges its burdens","j":30,"h":60,"s":99,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"99:3","t":"And man says, \"What is [wrong] with it?\" -","j":30,"h":60,"s":99,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"99:4","t":"That Day, it will report its news","j":30,"h":60,"s":99,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"99:5","t":"Because your Lord has inspired [i.e., commanded] it.","j":30,"h":60,"s":99,"a":5,"sd":null},{"k":"99:6","t":"That Day, the people will depart separated [into categories] to be shown [the result of] their deeds.","j":30,"h":60,"s":99,"a":6,"sd":null},{"k":"99:7","t":"So whoever does an atom's weight of good will see it,","j":30,"h":60,"s":99,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"99:8","t":"And whoever does an atom's weight of evil will see it.","j":30,"h":60,"s":99,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"100:1","t":"By the racers, panting,","j":30,"h":60,"s":100,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"100:2","t":"And the producers of sparks [when] striking","j":30,"h":60,"s":100,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"100:3","t":"And the chargers at dawn,","j":30,"h":60,"s":100,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"100:4","t":"Stirring up thereby [clouds of] dust,","j":30,"h":60,"s":100,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"100:5","t":"Arriving thereby in the center collectively,","j":30,"h":60,"s":100,"a":5,"sd":null}],"juz":30,"hizb":60,"surahs":[98,99,100],"sajdah":false}